OL,3,ACarney eyes 'other options' for
OL,4,Aembattled Canadian auto sector on China
OL,5,Atrip
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe plight of Canada's car industry has
OL,8,Fbecome one of the clearest stress tests
OL,9,Fof Ottawa's effort to weather US
OL,10,Ftariffs and chart a path forward.
OL,12,FThe past year and a half has been tough
OL,13,Fon the sector since US President Donald
OL,14,FTrump imposed a 25% tariff on
OL,15,Fnon-American-made vehicles, upending
OL,16,Fdecades of free trade and automotive
OL,17,Fintegration with Canada.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
