OL,3,ACarney eyes 'other options' for
OL,4,Aembattled Canadian auto sector on China
OL,5,Atrip
OL,6,
OL,7,FNow Prime Minister Mark Carney has
OL,8,Fsignalled that he is looking to China,
OL,9,Fwhere he is on a visit for the
OL,10,FAsia-Pacific Economic Cooperation
OL,11,Fsummit (Apec), as part of the solution.
OL,13,FBut that avenue is not without
OL,14,Fcontroversy, and is once again drawing
OL,15,Fthe ire of those close to Trump.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
